
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>MicroAI · BTM-1.1.5 Nova</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">

<header>
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="logo">M</div>
    <div>
      <h1>MicroAI</h1>
      <div class="small">BTM-1.1.5 Nova · Smart Chat</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="nav">
    <button id="newChat">＋ New chat</button>
    <button id="showArchives" class="secondary">▤ Chats</button>
    <button id="showSettings" class="secondary">⚙ Settings</button>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><strong id="sentenceCount">0</strong><span>Training sentences</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><strong id="wordCount">0</strong><span>Unique words</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><strong id="archiveCount">0</strong><span>Saved chats</span></div>
</div>

<div id="status" class="small">MicroAI is getting ready...</div>
<div id="chatSize" class="small">Chat size: 0 B</div>

<section id="chatView" class="view active">
  <div id="chat" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <div id="emojiPanel"></div>
  <form id="form" class="row">
    <input id="prompt" placeholder="Message MicroAI..." autocomplete="off" required>
    <button id="send">Send</button>
  </form>
  <div class="row">
    <button type="button" id="emojiToggle" class="secondary">😄 Emojis</button>
    <button type="button" id="clearCurrent" class="secondary">New chat</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="archiveView" class="view">
  <div>
    <h2 id="archivesTitle">📚 Saved chats</h2>
    <div class="small" id="archivesHelp">Open, rename, or delete your conversations.</div>
  </div>
  <div id="archiveList"></div>
  <button id="backToChat" class="secondary">← Back to chat</button>
</section>

<section id="settingsView" class="view">
  <div>
    <h2 id="settingsHeading">⚙ Settings</h2>
    <div class="small" id="settingsDescription">Manage language, appearance, and chat saving.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel">
    <label class="small" for="languageSetting" id="languageLabel">Language</label>
    <select id="languageSetting" style="width:100%;margin:6px 0 14px;padding:11px;border:1px solid #414b60;border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit">
      <option value="en">English</option>
      <option value="tr">Türkçe</option>
      <option value="de">Deutsch</option>
      <option value="fr">Français</option>
      <option value="it">Italiano</option>
      <option value="es">Español</option>
      <option value="ru">Русский</option>
      <option value="ar">العربية</option>
      <option value="pt">Português</option>
      <option value="la">Latina</option>
      <option value="ja">日本語</option>
    </select>
    <label class="small" for="themeSetting" id="themeLabel">Theme</label>
    <select id="themeSetting" style="width:100%;margin:6px 0 14px;padding:11px;border:1px solid #414b60;border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit">
      <option value="dark">Dark</option>
      <option value="light">Light</option>
    </select>
    <label class="row" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin:4px 0 14px">
      <input id="autoSaveSetting" type="checkbox" style="width:auto">
      <span id="autoSaveLabel">Automatically save chats</span>
    </label>
    <p class="small" id="autoSaveHelp">When off, new chat changes won't be saved after you reload the page.</p>
    <button type="button" id="showAbout" class="secondary">ℹ About</button>
  </div>
  <button id="settingsBackToChat" class="secondary">← Back to chat</button>
</section>

<section id="aboutView" class="view">
  <div class="panel about-content">
    <h2 id="aboutHeading">ℹ️ About MicroAI</h2>
    <p><strong id="createdLabel">Created on:</strong> <span id="createdDate">20.10.2026</span></p>
    <p><strong id="versionLabel">Version:</strong> MicroAI · BTM-1.1.5 Nova</p>
    <p><strong id="aboutBtmTitle">BTM-1.1.5 Nova: What does BTM mean?</strong></p>
    <p id="aboutBtmDescription">BTM stands for "Browser-Trainable Model." MicroAI is a small, browser-based, trainable AI model.</p>
    <p id="aboutNotLanguageModel">MicroAI is not a language model.</p>
    <p id="aboutText1">MicroAI is an experimental chat project that runs in your browser. It uses training examples, simple matching, and rule-based responses.</p>
    <p id="aboutText2">Chats and preferences are stored in this browser. Python examples are displayed but not executed; HTML previews open in an isolated area.</p>
    <p class="small" id="aboutText3">This project is not a general-purpose AI model; its responses may be incorrect or incomplete.</p>
  </div>
  <button id="aboutBackToChat" class="secondary">← Back to chat</button>
</section>

<details class="panel">
  <summary>🧠 Training data</summary>
  <p class="small">Write one sentence per line. Retrain the model to use new data.</p>
  <textarea id="data" rows="8" placeholder="Training sentences"></textarea>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px">
    <button type="button" id="train">Train model</button>
    <button type="button" id="addExample" class="secondary">Add example</button>
    <button type="button" id="resetTraining" class="secondary">Default data</button>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="panel">
  <summary>👤 User preferences and memory</summary>
  <p class="small">Manage your preferred name and notes for MicroAI to remember.</p>
  <label class="small" for="nickname">How should I address you?</label>
  <input id="nickname" maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. Friend" style="margin:6px 0 12px">
  <label class="small" for="userFacts">Notes to remember</label>
  <textarea id="userFacts" rows="3" maxlength="1500" placeholder="e.g. My favorite game is Minecraft."></textarea>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px">
    <button type="button" id="savePreferences">Save</button>
    <button type="button" id="forgetPreferences" class="secondary">Clear preferences</button>
  </div>
  <p class="small">Try “Remember: ...” or “Forget this” in chat.</p>
</details>

<footer id="footerText">MicroAI BTM-1.1.5 Nova · Experimental browser-based chat system. Chats are stored in this browser. Python code is not executed.</footer>
</div>

